Project layout, conventions and CI structure follow gufo
(https://github.com/gufo-org/gufo), MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 gufo
contributors. tools/ci/check-pr-title.py, .clang-format and .clang-tidy are
adapted from it.

NPU kernels are built with, and may include code from:
- MLIR-AIE (https://github.com/Xilinx/mlir-aie), Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
- IRON (https://github.com/amd/IRON), Apache-2.0
- llvm-aie / Peano (https://github.com/Xilinx/llvm-aie), Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
The runtime image bundles XRT (https://github.com/Xilinx/XRT), Apache-2.0.
